---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import premises from '../assets/photos/front-premises.jpg';
---

<section id="who-we-are" class="bg-brand-50/60 py-20 lg:py-28">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-page) px-6">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
			<div class="order-2 lg:order-1" data-reveal>
				<Image
					src={premises}
					alt="The FARMS LANKA office and community development centre in Moratuwa, set among trees"
					widths={[480, 800, 1200]}
					sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw"
					loading="lazy"
					class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover"
				/>
			</div>

			<div class="order-1 lg:order-2" data-reveal>
				<h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-950 md:text-4xl">Who We Are</h2>
				<div class="mt-6 max-w-[50ch] space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
					<p>
						FARMS LANKA is a Christian humanitarian organization dedicated to relief and
						development, faithfully serving communities across Sri Lanka since 1973. Founded to
						address fundamental human needs such as food security, shelter, proper education,
						and sustainable livelihoods, we began by empowering communities through
						agriculture and animal husbandry. As the needs of communities evolved, our work expanded into sewing,
						fisheries, handicrafts, grocery, carpentry, cottage industry, and other
						family-based initiatives.
					</p>
					<p>
						For more than five decades we have served with compassion, dignity, and practical
						support, inspired by the love of Christ and a desire to demonstrate God's love through
						meaningful action, helping families build sustainable, self-supporting futures.
					</p>
					<p>
						Today, by God's grace, the mission continues, serving communities, transforming lives,
						and bringing hope to those in need.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
